ssary  their methodology in regards to business  is incredibly similar to gangs such as  the accuser  an altercation with even the lowest  member can result in a quick and violent  reaction by the rest of the game  the leaders of the tiger clause believe  that in the long run business is  preferable  to constant bloodshed and battle however  they also realize that you can only get  so much done  without a machine gun and sadistic  brutes to further their cause  and this is where the low-level soldiers  come in highly aggressive  violent and sadistic they are prone to  undermining the superiors ideology of  the organization  but it doesn't matter as long as the top  brass get what they want in the end  by means of torture abduction provoking  fights  and sexual assault amongst others it  seems the ramifications  are near non-existent however  any act of retaliation on these  individuals will bring the whole gang's  wrath  upon the perpetrators in question the  gang must always appear united  and victorious in battle regardless of  what's going on behind the scenes  it is almost always advisable to avoid  retaliation and direct encounters with  any members of the tigers  unless there exists significant  connections with higher ranking members  the tiger claws are easily recognised by  the asian luminous tattoos  fast street bikes and katanas  night city's lead after dark  entertainment district is japan town  and this is where the tigers control a  large portion of the businesses  brothels bars casinos restaurants  and even the brain dance clubs are  mostly run by the tigers  [Music]  mostly legal businesses they also  provide a solid front for any money  laundering operations done by the gang  however the main volume for their money  comes from the prostitution and human  trafficking  with a significant number of corporate  connections particularly arasaka  many high executives can be seen  regularly entering tiger claws  establishments and clubs  often carrying out 